here are infinitely many solutions to the system. Therefore, the lines have infinitely many intersection points.\n\nWe want to find an expression that represents every solution to the system. Any value of $x$ can be chosen, and we can find the corresponding $y$-coordinate for each $x$-coordinate by solving one of the lines for $y$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2x - y &= 1 \\\\\n-y &= 1 - 2x \\\\\ny &= \\frac{1 - 2x}{-1} \\\\\ny &= -1 + 2x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $u=x$ be the free coordinate.\n\nTherefore, the points of intersection are\n\n$$\n\\left(u,-1 + 2u \\right)\n$$\n\nwhere $u$ is any number." 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542449 1080 "(u, \\frac{8}{5}u - \\frac{9}{5})" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542449 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542449 1083 #uuid "1fa567d4-0454-5e1f-a013-55cfb13bce47" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542450 1080 "(u, -\\frac{7}{5}u - \\frac{4}{5})" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542450 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542450 1083 #uuid "20d56e4e-14df-5e76-8811-2258751260f4" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542451 1080 "(u, -1)" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542451 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542451 1083 #uuid "216e4d60-197f-5cc4-a6a9-1f0aa4798fd2" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542452 1068 #edb/ref 17592186542498 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542452 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542452 1071 "Describe the points that lie on the intersection of the lines $2x - y =-6$ and $6x - 3y =-18$. Express your answer in terms of $t$ only.\n\nThe intersection points are $(t$,\n{{field-1}}\n$)$, where $t$ is any number." 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [17592186542452 1072 #uuid "23da70bf-d870-5a7b-895c-27d6ebda3437" 13194139535922 17592186045443 true] [